  read_data CPU = 0.006 seconds
pair_style      hybrid/overlay lj/cut 12.0 coul/long 12.0 coul/shield/intra 12.0 all cbrt
pair_coeff      * * lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * coul/long
pair_coeff      * * coul/shield/intra 0.2372
kspace_style    pppm/samqeq 1.0e-6
kspace_modify   slab 3.0 mesh 24 28 80 gewald 0.35
Updated KSpace settings:
  KSpace computation is turned:    ON
  Use MPI collective operations:   OFF
  Use MPI non-blocking operations: OFF
  Gewald manually set to:          0.35
  Slab volfactor manually set to:    3
neighbor        2.0 bin
set             atom 1 charge -0.01
Setting atom values ...
  1 settings made for charge
set             atom 240 charge 0.01
Setting atom values ...
  1 settings made for charge
fix             ef  all efield 0.0 0.0 0.5
fix             chg all qeq/sam 1 0.0 12.0 1.0e-8 au_pqeq.param
fix_modify      chg shield cbrt
samqeq: lr-solve shielding = cbrt J_shield (param 4th col = gamma); routed through compute_H + add_fixed_charge_field + the legacy gas path (calc_Hval)
fix_modify      chg gself on width 0.50
samqeq: gself ON -- finite-width charge self-energy K_e*sqrt(2a/pi) ADDED to the on-site diagonal (width 0.500 A for all types); folded into eta from eta0 at init()
fix_modify      chg ridge eig 1000.0 200
samqeq: ridge mode = Lanczos lambda_min: ridge = max(lr_ridge, 1000 + 0 - lambda_min) eV (floor + delta), 200 Lanczos steps, recomputed every 1 step(s) (continuous in config; matrix kept PD). The Ritz estimate is an UPPER bound on lambda_min: an unconverged m can only MISS a negative mode, never invent one -- m >= 60 recommended for interface cells; delta is the estimate-error budget, so lambda_min(A+ridge) >= floor whenever the estimate is within delta of the true value
run             0

